{"id":"ab5b845cf7d367cd","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-recursive-real-relation.md","title":"Recursive Relations with Real Arguments","display":"df-recursive-real-relation — Recursive Relations with Real Arguments","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-recursive-real-relation","aliases":["68-df-recursive-real-relation"],"display":"df-recursive-real-relation — Recursive Relations with Real Arguments","depends_on":["[[68-df-baire-space]]","[[68-df-recursive-real-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§18 pp.67–69 / PDF 76–78","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-recursive-real-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-recursive-real-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-real-relation — Recursive Relations with Real Arguments"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f3126eb15a4d7bf1\" href=\"?note=f3126eb15a4d7bf1\" title=\"68-df-recursive-real-function\">68-df-recursive-real-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§18 pp.67–69 / PDF 76–78"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X_{m,k}\">\\(R\\subseteq X_{m,k}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3126eb15a4d7bf1\" href=\"?note=f3126eb15a4d7bf1\" title=\"68-df-recursive-real-function\">68-df-recursive-real-function</a>。特征函数采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 为真的约定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_R^{(m,k)}:=\\{(p,1):p\\in R\\}\\cup\\{(p,0):p\\in X_{m,k}\\setminus R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_R^{(m,k)}:=\\{(p,1):p\\in R\\}\\cup\\{(p,0):p\\in X_{m,k}\\setminus R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\chi_R^{(m,k)}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\chi_R^{(m,k)}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §18，印刷 pp.67–69 / PDF pp.76–78 把关系的 representing function 一同推广。本目录沿用 1 为真的特征函数，与原书的真假数值约定可有效互换，递归关系类不变。定义要求特征函数对所有实和数输入都停机，不能仅以半判定程序替代。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-baire-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-real-function","status":"resolved","id":"f3126eb15a4d7bf1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-real-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-real-function","status":"resolved","id":"f3126eb15a4d7bf1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$R\\subseteq X_{m,k}$。$\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-real-function]]。特征函数采用 $1$ 为真的约定。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_R^{(m,k)}:=\\{(p,1):p\\in R\\}\\cup\\{(p,0):p\\in X_{m,k}\\setminus R\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\chi_R^{(m,k)}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1368,"backlinks":[{"id":"b56f83b0418112cc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61df304a04864967","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$X_{m,k}$ 见 [[68-df-baire-space]]；$\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}$ 是 [[68-df-recursive-real-relation]] 中无固定外加实参数的递归关系类。生成算子 $\\sigma_X$ 见 [[68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations]]。$A\\subseteq X_{m,k}$。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-real-relation]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-real-relation]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-real-relation|df-recursive-real-relation — Recursive Relations with Real Arguments]]"}],"outgoing":["4bd688e6777d088c","f3126eb15a4d7bf1"]}